Dara and Nok are close friends. They get on well and always respect each other. Last year, they fell out over a small problem, but they made up quickly. Dara finds it easy to make friends, but some people are just an acquaintance. Her cousin has just got engaged! But her friend Sophy broke up with her boyfriend.

